Cc: linux-nfc-hn68Rpc1hR1g9hUCZPvPmw@public.gmane.org, christophe-h.ricard-qxv4g6HH51o@public.gmane.org, devicetree-u79uwXL29TY76Z2rM5mHXA@public.gmane.org, christophe.ricard-Re5JQEeQqe8AvxtiuMwx3w@public.gmane.org
List-Id: devicetree@vger.kernel.org

ndlc_remove already call st21nfcb_nci_i2c_disable and phy->powered is
already set to 0.

Signed-off-by: Christophe Ricard <christophe-h.ricard-qxv4g6HH51o@public.gmane.org>
---
 drivers/nfc/st21nfcb/i2c.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/nfc/st21nfcb/i2c.c b/drivers/nfc/st21nfcb/i2c.c
index 4bc15ec..c44f8cf 100644
--- a/drivers/nfc/st21nfcb/i2c.c
+++ b/drivers/nfc/st21nfcb/i2c.c
@@ -359,9 +359,6 @@ static int st21nfcb_nci_i2c_remove(struct i2c_client *client)
 
 	ndlc_remove(phy->ndlc);
 
-	if (phy->powered)
-		st21nfcb_nci_i2c_disable(phy);
-
 	return 0;
 }
 
